# html-minifier vulnerability - transitive dependency from mjml (email templating)
# CVE-2022-37620: ReDoS vulnerability
# Status: No fix available, only used in development/email rendering
# Risk: LOW - mjml only processes trusted email templates, not user input
CVE-2022-37620

# zlib1g vulnerability in Debian base image
# CVE-2023-45853: Integer overflow and resultant heap-based buffer overflow in zipOpenNewFileInZip4_6
# Status: will_not_fix in Debian 12.12
# Risk: LOW - Application doesn't use vulnerable zip functionality directly
# Note: Requires upgrading to Debian 13 (not yet stable) or accepting risk
CVE-2023-45853
